~02ออออ~0Aอออ ~0FCONTROLS ~0Aออออออออ~02อออออออออออออออออออออออออ

There are two keyboard schemes for controlling the
pieces, which can be customized using the ~04Options~07
menu. The keys are as follows.

 ~0E* ~0FMove left~08 . . . . . . . . ~0BA~07 or ~0BLeft arrow
 ~0E* ~0FMove right~08. . . . . . . . ~0BD~07 or ~0BRight arrow
 ~0E* ~0FMove down~08 . . . . . . . . ~0BS~07 or ~0BDown arrow
 ~0E* ~0FClockwise spin~08. . . . . . ~09W~07 or ~09Up arrow
 ~0E* ~0FCounter clockwise spin~08. . ~09Q~07 or ~09/
 ~0E* ~0FDrop piece~08. . . . . . . . ~0DSPACE~07 or ~0DENTER
 ~0E* ~0FPause game~08. . . . . . . . ~0DP
 ~0E* ~0FToggle piece shadow~08 . . . ~0CH
 ~0E* ~0FToggle color-blind mode~08 . ~0CB
 ~0E* ~0FQuit game~08 . . . . . . . . ~0CESC

By default, the scheme ~03W~09A~0DD~0CS~07 is used.
